Same old Necromancer who had the trouble with Vecna
that I posted a week or so ago.

Made it to the Quest.  Entered with trepidation, remembering
the horrible deaths of my last 3 or 4 Necromancers who
made it this far.  This time I had a good gaggle of pets
though : 2 vampires lords, 1 vampire mage, a ghost and
a gugg (the other gug bit it).

Made it to the nemesis room, woke him up.. he started
cursing.  Stepped to the corner, whistled my pets around
me.  Nemesis teleported to attack but the pets gave him
no room and he was 2 squares away.  Waited for my pets
to get out of the way, but the nemesis immediately teleported
to the upstairs.  (Why?  Maybe the vampires and gugg gave
him a pounding? In all the excitement I didn't check.)
Using my new wonder-command, ctrl-t, I follow to 6 squares
away.  Nemesis falls in 3 rounds to a hail of +6 daggers.
He never laid a glove on me.

